## Internal Structure

```text
src/
├── index.ts                 → stdio entry point
├── server.ts                → shared scoped MCP server
├── auth.ts                  → account/auth resolution
├── tools/                   → automation tier handlers
├── resources/               → database tier handlers
├── prompts/                 → judgment tier handlers
├── schemas/                 → validation contracts
└── orchestration/           → auth/bootstrap helpers

worker/
├── index.ts                 → Cloudflare Worker entry point with /health
└── wrangler.toml            → deployment bindings and runtime config
```

## To Understand This Package, Read

1. **`README.md`** — package overview and Agent Legibility Contract
